{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918320/extras/5a7baa0f48d1a940bc96ee37b26d5649.apng?t=1740067218\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918320/extras/5a7baa0f48d1a940bc96ee37b26d5649.poster.avif?t=1740067218\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=150 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918320/extras/292fd54ee46165af43f22786a7dd72de.poster.avif?t=1740067218\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918320/extras/292fd54ee46165af43f22786a7dd72de.webm?t=1740067218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918320/extras/292fd54ee46165af43f22786a7dd72de.mp4?t=1740067218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918320/extras/a1561d119c1668a7f31c29074eaa5d16.webp?t=1740067218\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Use power-ups to turn the scores. If you've always wanted to catch your friends with a giant laser pointer or shoot'em with a cheese cannon you can do it all! Just watch out for those flying yarn balls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918320/extras/90d898be810c66c243534853fa2292e5.webp?t=1740067218\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Play with up to 4 players (including bots) in 4 game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918320/extras/53d934db456f71bb8436aed9d765469a.webp?t=1740067218\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Grow your kitten collection and collect them all. Complete various tasks and secret challenges and you're reward will be...                                                             You guessed right, more kittens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918320/extras/f2edc080307a4affe9ce48c6de66801e.webp?t=1740067218\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Master all the levels, so you won't lose one of your nine lives. If surviving the power-ups isn't tricky enough, you'll have to watch out for crazy traps too. Surely moving cars, blackouts and eagles aren't that bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support for Xbox, PS, Pro Controller and JoyCons</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Air Kitten","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1918320/d7b799e3f8b4dad962ff84dca39903fdeda512c2.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1918320/d189997f2ee321e20fe2c0f4c90733d2c99d35be.jpg"},{"name":"Getting the hang of it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1918320/958a3d4769433bd076473bf6d8c08ee99fb4564d.jpg"},{"name":"Halfway there","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1918320/0b7e29783143bdff181ce85ec6a1a13c081ee889.jpg"},{"name":"Now what?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1918320/08095deebd8da094a49789b94c11e0565fa8c68e.jpg"},{"name":"You didn't even score!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1918320/6e901dc7f745153a92